"Cadmium travels on fine particles and returns with rain and dry deposition, mostly in the region around its sources.": "鎘附著在細顆粒上傳輸，隨降雨和乾沉降回到地面，大多落在污染源附近的區域。",
"Inhaled Cd particles harm the lungs and kidneys near smelters; at background levels air is a minor route compared with food.": "在冶煉廠附近吸入含鎘顆粒會傷害肺和腎；在背景濃度下，空氣相對於食物是次要途徑。",
