"Cd on deposited dust": "沉降粉塵上的鎘",
"Stored in snow and ice": "儲存在雪和冰中",
"Snow and ice store deposited cadmium with dust and release it during melt. Taiwan has no glaciers; this compartment belongs to the original Alpine scene.": "雪和冰會連同粉塵儲存沉降的鎘，融化時釋出。台灣沒有冰河，這個介質屬於原本的阿爾卑斯山剖面。",
