"Natural": "天然",
"Cd in black shale and phosphate rock": "黑色頁岩和磷礦岩中的鎘",
"Geogenic": "地質成因",
"Most rocks contain little cadmium; it is enriched in zinc ores, black shales and phosphate rock. Weathering of sulfide ores releases it together with zinc.": "大多數岩石含鎘很少；鎘富集在鋅礦、黑色頁岩和磷礦岩中。硫化礦風化時會和鋅一起釋出。",
"Geogenic cadmium matters mainly near zinc mines and phosphate deposits.": "地質成因的鎘主要在鋅礦和磷礦附近才重要。",
