"Cd²⁺ on humus": "腐植質上的 Cd²⁺",
"Mainly from deposition": "主要來自沉降",
"Dissolved Cd in acidic soil water": "酸性土壤水中的溶解態鎘",
"Mobile at low pH": "低 pH 時移動性高",
"In acidic forest soils cadmium binds weakly and part of it leaches to groundwater and streams; humus layers keep deposited cadmium for decades.": "在酸性森林土壤中，鎘結合較弱，部分會淋溶到地下水和溪流；腐植質層會把沉降的鎘保留數十年。",
"Exposure mainly through mushrooms and game near polluted areas.": "暴露主要來自污染區附近的菇類和野味。",
