"Dissolved Cd²⁺": "溶解態 Cd²⁺",
"Taken up by rice and leafy vegetables": "被稻米和葉菜類吸收",
"CdS in flooded paddy soil": "淹水稻田中的 CdS",
"Forms under reducing conditions and dissolves again when the field is drained": "在還原條件下形成，田間排水後再溶出",
"Cadmium enters farmland with polluted irrigation water, phosphate fertilisers and sludge. Its availability to crops rises as soil pH falls; in paddies it is held as CdS while the field is flooded and released when it is drained.": "鎘隨受污染的灌溉水、磷肥和污泥進入農地。土壤 pH 越低，作物越容易吸收；稻田淹水時鎘以 CdS 固定，排水後又會釋出。",
"Rice and vegetables from polluted fields are the main exposure route; long-term intake damages the kidneys.": "污染農田生產的稻米和蔬菜是主要暴露途徑；長期攝入會損害腎臟。",
"Lime acidic soils to raise the pH": "對酸性土壤施用石灰以提高 pH",
