"Keep polluted water out of irrigation channels": "不讓污染水進入灌溉渠道",
"Remove or replace heavily polluted topsoil": "移除或更換嚴重污染的表土",
"organic carbon": "有機碳",
"irrigation water quality": "灌溉水質",
"crop type": "作物種類",
"water regime": "水分狀態",
"Acidic soil: more Cd in solution and in crops.": "酸性土壤：溶液和作物中的鎘增加。",
"Flooded, reducing soil: Cd is fixed as CdS until the field is drained.": "淹水還原的土壤：鎘以 CdS 固定，直到田間排水。",
"Cd in plating and pigment waste": "電鍍和顏料廢棄物中的鎘",
"Industrial": "工業",
"Cd in dust and runoff": "灰塵和逕流中的鎘",
"Urban surfaces": "都市地表",
"Plating, pigments, batteries and plastic stabilisers are the main industrial uses; wastewater and dust carry cadmium to sewers, soils and rivers.": "電鍍、顏料、電池和塑膠安定劑是主要的工業用途；廢水和灰塵把鎘帶到下水道、土壤和河川。",
"Local exposure near factories and along polluted irrigation channels.": "工廠附近和受污染灌溉渠道沿線的局部暴露。",
"Treat plating wastewater at the source": "在源頭處理電鍍廢水",
