"Mobile under acidic conditions": "酸性條件下移動性高",
"At contaminated sites cadmium often occurs with zinc, nickel and chromium from plating or smelting waste; acidic seepage can carry it to groundwater.": "污染場址中的鎘常與電鍍或冶煉廢棄物中的鋅、鎳、鉻一起出現；酸性入滲水會把它帶到地下水。",
"Groundwater and nearby crops can be affected.": "可能影響地下水和附近的作物。",
"Excavate or contain hot spots": "開挖或圍封熱點",
