"Smoking, workplaces": "吸菸、職業場所",
"Cadmium builds up in the kidneys over decades, so long-term intake matters more than single exposures.": "鎘在腎臟中累積數十年，所以長期攝入比單次暴露更重要。",
"Kidney damage and bone loss; itai-itai disease in Japan was caused by Cd-polluted rice.": "腎臟損傷和骨質流失；日本的痛痛病就是由受鎘污染的稻米引起。",
