"Most of the incoming Cd": "大部分進流的鎘",
"Dissolved Cd in effluent": "放流水中的溶解態鎘",
"Smaller share": "較小部分",
"Treatment plants move most cadmium from water into sludge; spreading that sludge on fields returns it to soil.": "污水廠把大部分的鎘從水中轉移到污泥；把污泥施用到農田又會讓鎘回到土壤。",
"Mainly a sludge disposal question.": "主要是污泥處置的問題。",
