"Keep Cd-rich sludge off farmland": "含鎘污泥不施用於農地",
"inflow load": "進流負荷",
"sludge use": "污泥用途",
"Dissolved Cd²⁺ and complexes": "溶解態 Cd²⁺ 和錯合物",
"Large share when suspended sediment is low": "懸浮泥砂少時占大部分",
"Cd on suspended particles": "懸浮顆粒上的鎘",
"Rises with suspended sediment": "隨懸浮泥砂增加",
"In rivers cadmium is more often dissolved than lead; floods carry the particle-bound share downstream to estuaries and the sea.": "在河川中，鎘比鉛更常以溶解態存在；洪水把顆粒態的部分帶到下游的河口和海洋。",
"Irrigation from polluted rivers or channels spreads cadmium to fields.": "從受污染的河川或渠道取水灌溉會把鎘帶到農田。",
"Treat discharges upstream of irrigation intakes": "在灌溉取水口上游處理排放水",
