"In lakes and reservoirs cadmium settles with particles; under anoxic, sulfidic bottom water it is fixed as CdS.": "在湖泊和水庫中，鎘隨顆粒沉降；底層水缺氧且含硫化物時，鎘以 CdS 固定。",
"Fish and shellfish can accumulate cadmium.": "魚類和貝類可能累積鎘。",
