"Oxic surface layer": "好氧的表層",
"Sediments store cadmium as sulfide while they stay anoxic; dredging or oxidation releases it.": "底泥保持缺氧時以硫化物儲存鎘；清淤或氧化會讓它釋出。",
"A source again if disturbed or oxidised.": "受擾動或氧化時會再次成為污染源。",
"Avoid resuspending polluted sediment": "避免讓受污染底泥再懸浮",
"redox state": "氧化還原狀態",
"sulfide": "硫化物",
"More mobile in acidic, low-carbonate aquifers": "在酸性、低碳酸鹽的含水層中移動性較高",
