"Retarded by sorption": "因吸附而遲滯",
"Cadmium reaches groundwater where soils are acidic or sandy and the input is large; in neutral, carbonate-rich aquifers it moves slowly.": "在土壤偏酸或砂質、輸入量大的地方，鎘會到達地下水；在中性、富含碳酸鹽的含水層中移動緩慢。",
