"Cadmium sulfide, formed": "生成的硫化鎘",
"Dissolved Cd, free and with chloride or organic carbon": "溶解態鎘（游離或與氯、有機碳錯合）",
"Cadmium on dust particles": "粉塵顆粒上的鎘",
"Cadmium · Z 48": "鎘 Cadmium · Z 48",
"Cadmium TWI 2.5 µg/kg bw per week (EFSA 2011)": "鎘的每週容許攝入量 2.5 µg/kg 體重（EFSA 2011）",
"Nickel": "鎳",
"Plating site": "電鍍場址",
"A metal of plating and stainless steel. Ni²⁺ binds to oxides and organic matter more weakly than lead but more strongly than cadmium; it becomes mobile in acidic soils and aquifers.": "電鍍和不鏽鋼使用的金屬。Ni²⁺ 與氧化物和有機質的結合比鉛弱、比鎘強；在酸性土壤和含水層中會變得容易移動。",
"Treat plating wastewater at the source, keep it out of irrigation channels, and keep soil pH near neutral.": "在源頭處理電鍍廢水，不讓它進入灌溉渠道，並讓土壤 pH 維持在接近中性。",
"Nickel is a common skin allergen. Long-term intake from food and water is compared with a tolerable daily intake of 13 µg/kg body weight (EFSA 2020); some inhaled nickel compounds cause lung cancer.": "鎳是常見的皮膚過敏原。由食物和水長期攝入的量，以每日容許攝入量 13 µg/kg 體重比較（EFSA 2020）；部分吸入的鎳化合物會導致肺癌。",
"Taiwan soil pollution control standard for Ni: 200 mg/kg (monitoring standard 130 mg/kg); no separate value for farmland.": "台灣土壤污染管制標準（鎳）：200 mg/kg（監測標準 130 mg/kg）；農地沒有另訂數值。",
