"Treat plating wastewater at the source, reduce Cr(VI) to Cr(III) before discharge, and keep it out of irrigation channels.": "在源頭處理電鍍廢水，排放前把 Cr(VI) 還原成 Cr(III)，並不讓它進入灌溉渠道。",
