"Release to a glacier-fed river (melt)": "釋放到冰河補注的河川（融化）",
"Excavate or contain soil above the soil pollution control standard, or restrict its use for gardens, playgrounds and crops.": "開挖或圍封超過土壤污染管制標準的土壤，或限制作為庭園、遊戲場和種植作物的用途。",
"Stop further input and check use restrictions: the soil is above the soil pollution monitoring standard.": "停止繼續輸入並檢討使用限制：土壤超過土壤污染監測標準。",
"Cut oxygen and water inflow with a cover or cap, and fix arsenic with iron: Fe-oxide amendments or a zero-valent-iron barrier in the seepage path.": "用覆蓋或封頂阻斷氧氣和水的進入，並用鐵固定砷：添加鐵氧化物，或在入滲路徑設置零價鐵屏障。",
"Immobilise lead with phosphate (not on As-rich soils) or by liming acidic soil; at active ranges install artificial bullet traps.": "用磷酸鹽固定鉛（富砷土壤不適用），或對酸性土壤施用石灰；使用中的靶場加裝人工彈頭收集設施。",
"Remove mercury hotspots or contain them with a sealing wall; keep the soil aerated to avoid methylation.": "移除汞的熱點或用阻隔牆圍封；保持土壤通氣以避免甲基化。",
"Stop polluted irrigation water and lime acidic soil: cadmium binds more strongly at higher pH (Sauvé et al. 2000).": "停止使用受污染的灌溉水並對酸性土壤施用石灰：pH 越高，鎘的吸附越強（Sauvé et al. 2000）。",
"Stop the seepage source and lime acidic soil: nickel binds more strongly at higher pH (Sauvé et al. 2000).": "阻斷入滲的污染源並對酸性土壤施用石灰：pH 越高，鎳的吸附越強（Sauvé et al. 2000）。",
"Remove hot spots below plating baths, and reduce Cr(VI) in the soil with ferrous iron or organic amendments, which turns it into far less mobile Cr(III) (Palmer & Puls 1994).": "移除電鍍槽下方的熱點，並用二價鐵或有機質改良劑還原土壤中的 Cr(VI)，使它變成移動性低很多的 Cr(III)（Palmer & Puls 1994）。",
"Antimony leaches much faster than lead and phosphate does not hold it: collect or treat seepage with iron-based sorbents and monitor Sb in groundwater.": "銻的淋溶比鉛快很多，磷酸鹽也固定不住：收集入滲水或用鐵系吸附劑處理，並監測地下水中的銻。",
"Erosion, not leaching, is the main way the metal leaves this soil: keep vegetation cover, add buffer strips or sediment traps, and avoid bare ground.": "金屬離開這塊土壤主要靠沖蝕而不是淋溶：保持植被覆蓋，增設緩衝帶或沉砂設施，避免裸露地面。",
"Groundwater could exceed the limit in part of the uncertainty range or if fast paths exist: monitor seepage and groundwater below the source.": "在部分不確定範圍內或有優勢流時，地下水可能超過標準：監測污染源下方的入滲水和地下水。",
"Protect the water supply: iron-hydroxide (GFH) adsorbers, oxidation with Fe(III) coagulation, or blending with low-arsenic water.": "保護供水：使用氫氧化鐵（GFH）吸附設備、氧化後以 Fe(III) 混凝，或混合低砷水。",
"Contain the plume hydraulically, or treat the water by coagulation-filtration or ion exchange.": "以水力方式圍堵污染團，或用混凝過濾、離子交換處理。",
"Contain the plume with sealing walls; treat the water with activated carbon or thiol resins.": "用阻隔牆圍堵污染團；用活性碳或硫醇樹脂處理。",
"Contain the plume, or reduce Cr(VI) in place (ferrous iron or a reactive barrier); treat pumped water by reduction and precipitation.": "圍堵污染團，或就地還原 Cr(VI)（二價鐵或反應牆）；抽出的水用還原沉澱法處理。",
"Karst or fractured rock: fast paths bypass soil retention. Protect recharge areas and sample springs after heavy rain.": "喀斯特或裂隙岩：優勢流會繞過土壤的阻滯。保護補注區，並在大雨後採集泉水樣品。",
"Retain particles before they reach the river: settling basins, runoff treatment and sediment traps below the source.": "在顆粒到達河川前攔截：在污染源下方設置沉砂池、逕流處理和沉砂設施。",
"Upgrade flue-gas cleaning (fabric filters or electrostatic precipitators) and monitor dust deposition around the stack.": "改善廢氣處理（濾袋或靜電集塵器），並監測煙囪周圍的粉塵沉降。",
"Limit methylation: keep lake bottom water oxic (aeration) and avoid flooding Hg-rich soils and wetlands.": "抑制甲基化：保持湖泊底層水好氧（曝氣），避免淹沒富汞土壤和濕地。",
"Advise pregnant women and children on fish consumption and measure methylmercury in predatory fish.": "提供孕婦和兒童食魚建議，並測量掠食性魚類中的甲基汞。",
"Mercury leaves Swiss topsoils faster than leaching, erosion and Hg⁰ emission explain (NABO trend data), probably by mixing into deeper soil: set Other losses on the Soil tab to test it.": "瑞士表土中汞減少的速度比淋溶、沖蝕和 Hg⁰ 排放能解釋的更快（瑞士 NABO 趨勢資料），可能是混入較深土層：可在土壤分頁設定「其他損失」測試。",
"Elemental mercury re-emits to air: measure soil-gas Hg, ventilate buildings and set Other losses to include re-emission.": "元素汞會再排放到空氣：測量土壤氣體中的汞、建築物通風，並在「其他損失」納入再排放。",
"Waterlogging releases As(III): improve drainage or add iron, and avoid phosphate fertiliser on this soil.": "淹水會釋出 As(III)：改善排水或添加鐵，並避免在這塊土壤施用磷肥。",
"Lime the soil: lead mobility rises sharply below pH 5 to 5.5.": "對土壤施用石灰：pH 低於 5 到 5.5 時鉛的移動性急遽上升。",
"Reduce direct contact: clean topsoil cover or raised beds in gardens, and keep children off bare contaminated soil.": "減少直接接觸：庭園覆蓋乾淨表土或使用高架植床，並讓兒童遠離裸露的污染土壤。",
"Measure Kd (or a leaching test) on site samples: it is the largest source of uncertainty in these results.": "用場址樣品測量 Kd（或做溶出試驗）：它是這些結果最大的不確定來源。",
"Most traffic metal stays within 5 m of the road: keep the shoulders vegetated, don't grow food there, and send road runoff over shoulders, retention soil filters or a road-runoff treatment plant (SABA) rather than straight into streams.": "交通產生的金屬大多留在道路 5 m 內：路肩保持植被、不要種植食用作物，並讓道路逕流經過路肩、滯留土壤過濾或道路逕流處理設施（瑞士稱 SABA），不要直接排入溪流。",
"Glacier melt releases metal deposited decades ago and cannot be stopped at the source: sample sediment and fish in glacier-fed lakes after hot summers, and site drinking-water intakes with this in mind.": "冰河融化會釋出數十年前沉降的金屬，無法在源頭阻止：炎熱夏季後採集冰河補注湖泊的底泥和魚類，設置飲用水取水口時也要考慮這點。",
"Air above the limit at the most exposed point: improve dust filters on the stack, and check which homes and schools lie in the main wind direction.": "最大暴露點的空氣超過標準：改善煙囪的集塵設備，並確認主要風向上有哪些住家和學校。",
"No exceedance at screening level. Confirm with measured soil, seepage and groundwater data before deciding.": "篩選層級沒有超標。做決定前請用實測的土壤、入滲水和地下水資料確認。",
