"Not included: dissolved metal scavenged into lake sediment, remobilised river and lake sediment, waterlogging after floods (arsenic release, Hg methylation), pumping by wells, and mixing into deeper soil unless you set Other losses.": "沒有納入：溶解態金屬被清除到湖泊底泥、河川和湖泊底泥再移動、洪水後的淹水（砷釋出、汞甲基化）、抽水井的抽水，以及混入較深土層（除非設定「其他損失」）。",
